truthai-mini builds against, and self-hosters serve alongside it, the following third-party work (the fonts under www/app/fonts/ are the only third-party files contained here; all code is built against, not bundled):

- WebLLM and MLC-LLM (Apache License 2.0) — https://github.com/mlc-ai/web-llm — the in-browser
  inference runtime (`www/vendor/web-llm.js`) and the compiled per-model WebGPU wasm libraries.
- Apache TVM (Apache License 2.0) — the compiler stack behind the wasm libraries.
- Qwen3 model weights (Apache License 2.0) — https://huggingface.co/Qwen — served as separate
  signed releases, not contained in this repository.
- Abliterated Qwen3 variants by mlabonne (Apache License 2.0) — https://huggingface.co/mlabonne.

tools/q4f16_1_convert.py is an independent GroupQuantize implementation written for this project (it targets
the MLC model layout but copies no MLC source). The code in this repository is MIT-licensed (see LICENSE). The Apache-2.0 artefacts above keep
their own licence and notices.


